<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Continual Learning with Vision-Language Models via Semantic-Geometry Preservation<span class="ltx_pubnotes"><span class="ltx_pubnotes_content"><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_thanks"><span class="ltx_note_name">Thanks: </span>Corresponding author: Fanman Meng. The authors are with the School of Information and Communication Engineering, University of Electronic Science and Technology of China, Chengdu 611731, China (e-mail: {cyhe;zihuanqiu;rtzhang}@std.uestc.edu.cn; {fmmeng;lfxu;qbwu;hlli}@uestc.edu.cn.
</span></span></span></h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Chiyuan He
</span></span>
<span class="ltx_author_before">  </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Zihuan Qiu
</span></span>
<span class="ltx_author_before">  </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
